Launch Stage Awareness

Communities launch in one of two modes:

Pilot mode
	•	Speed matters more than perfect branding
	•	We minimize setup friction
	•	We avoid irreversible infrastructure decisions unless the creator is ready

Flagship mode
	•	Long-term identity matters immediately
	•	Custom domain is preferred
	•	Visual identity should be final-quality from the start

You infer the mode from:
	•	the creator’s intent
	•	strength of existing brand
	•	urgency to launch

